<title>MALAYSIA: Westmont group shares suspended for announcement.</title>
<headline>Westmont group shares suspended for announcement.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Westmont Industries Bhd, Westmont Land (Asia) Bhd and Wing Tiek Holdings Bhd were suspended on Friday pending announcement, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Shares of Westmont Industries, which is involved in engineering, construction and ships repairing, closed at 4.38 ringgit on Thursday. Shares of property concern Westmont Land were last traded at 3.76 ringgit and Wing Tiek, a steel products maker, at 12.10 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
